Perun
Copyright 2026 lazyeel (https://github.com/lazyeel)

This product compiles and links the following software developed by lazyeel:
- Native binary projection runtime: PE32+ (Win32) and Mach-O x86_64
  (Darwin) image loading, relocation, import binding (perun-core)
- Guest API translation shims: Win32 to POSIX and macOS libSystem/Mach
  to Linux, including the FairPlay SAP session runtime (perun-shims)
- Command-line runner, image inspector, FairPlay SAP session driver, and
  the App Store client (perun-cli)

